      "content": "but if the data was so clear, wouldnt it be more \"responsible\" for a government to just push the science rather than entertaining debates that ended up costing lives? like, isnt it kind of dangerous to treat skepticism about proven medical facts as a \"valid philosophical point\" if that skepticism leads to people not getting vaccinated?",
